stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Active: thread 创建(run 开工)
    Active --> Archived: 收官归档(记录归档时刻)
    Archived --> Reopened: 有消息进来(Discord 自动打开)
    Reopened --> Archived: 重开者全是 bot,静窗核验后重新关
    Reopened --> FounderOpen: founder 发过言,系统不抢
    Archived --> Active: 新 run 启动(reactivation 清账本)
    FounderOpen --> Active: 新 run 启动
    FounderOpen --> Archived: founder 或 Lead 手动关
    note right of Archived
        若「重新关」中途出岔子
        会先留耐久 receipt(欠条)
        每次归档调用都续推
        直到 thread 验证恢复打开
    end note
